[{"title":"玉华谷同希颜裕之分韵得秋字","author":"李献能","text":"玉龙落峡喷飞流，空翠霏霏晚不收。\n软脚山堂一壶酒，莫凉閒对两峰秋。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1949,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"四皓图","author":"李献能","text":"弋缯安足致冥鸿，自是兼怀翊赞功。\n漫说壶关有遗老，望思台上已秋风。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1950,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"二老雪行图二首 其一","author":"李献能","text":"自笑胶胶扰扰身，十年匹马走红尘。\n何时雪满平生屐，太华峰前约故人。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1951,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"二老雪行图二首 其二","author":"李献能","text":"抱琴冲雪又冲风，二老风流阿堵中。\n未似村翁眵抹眼，火炉头上话年丰。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1952,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"别冯驾之","author":"李献能","text":"东风弄微寒，吹雪作轻阴。\n春归未得归，愁揽客子心。\n与君俱异县，那复重分襟。\n感时复恨别，老怀苦难任。\n忆昨荥阳会，灯火语夜深。\n纵谈间俳语，浩歌杂狂吟。\n相期梁宋游，感君肯相寻。\n西园偶差池，市楼成孤斟。\n相逢洧水湄，暂尔成盍簪。\n燕鸿还别去，又复如商参。\n我行落日边，匹马独登临。\n君方无定在，倦翼思茂林。\n人堪几回别，老境各骎骎。\n洧水不西流，双鱼定沉沉。\n幸有西飞鸿，无吝金玉音。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1953,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"昆阳元夜南寺小集","author":"李献能","text":"春皋短短生兰芽，东风袅袅吹芳华。\n暗黄着柳小梅素，月姊新年恰十五。\n东皇太一来翩翩，竹宫神光祀甘泉。\n茂陵弓剑没秋草，凤灯煌煌空自然。\n当年曼衍鱼龙舞，回头昭阳化飞土。\n昆阳客舍冷于冰，破殿萧条佛灯古。\n雪消梁苑想春红，车如流水马游龙。\n银瓶载酒随春风，酒酣一嚼百杯空。\n韶华过眼弦上箭，人生得酒从欢宴。\n北斗阑干夜参半，耿耿疏星淡河汉。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1954,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"追忆颍亭汎舟寄阳翟诸友","author":"李献能","text":"十月冬气寒，清霜殒群木。\n轻舟汎颍水，微风吹野服。\n信流不知还，石艇横老玉。\n苔花锦斓斑，悬溜珠䍡?。\n颇离廛市杂，倒泻轩裳俗。\n岁月今几何，春草萋以绿。\n怀归剧饥渴，仰羡双飞鹄。\n矫首九山云，迢迢伤远目。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1955,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郏城秋夜怀李仁卿","author":"李献能","text":"日入群动息，暝色阴濛濛。\n故人隔颍水，袅袅生秋风。\n轻风捲纤云，碧汉磨青铜。\n坐久襟袖凉，皎月升天东。\n伊人如此月，霁色罗心胸。\n可望不可亲，倏巳驾飞鸿。\n念此太虚间，心交神自通。\n而况千里月，相望宁不同。\n孤光透薄帷，俨如接音容。\n翻翻绕枝鹊，唧唧侵阶蛩。\n上床转不寐，高楼待晨钟。\n相思夜何永，月落秋床空。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1956,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"题飞伯诗囊飞伯以布为囊采当世名卿诗投其中","author":"李献能","text":"颖露毛锥秪自贤，智如樗腹但求全。\n迂疏差似渊才富，羞涩犹无杜老钱。\n收拾珠玑三万斛，贮储风月一千篇。\n呕心大胜奚奴锦，要与风人被管弦。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1957,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送王飞伯归阳翟","author":"李献能","text":"故旧相望似晓星，平生怀抱向君倾。\n朱丝不入秦筝耳，彩凤终仪韶濩声。\n三楚迢迢动离思，九山落落助高情。\n一廛拟就隆中卧，要子同躬垄上耕。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1958,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"西园春日","author":"李献能","text":"的皪冰梢出短墙，泓澄暖绿静横塘。\n娟娟高竹迎人翠，袅袅长红隔水香。\n病起心情疏酒盏，朝来风色妒年芳。\n只应归去芸窗晚，梦到湘妃锦瑟傍。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1959,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"荥阳古城登览寄裕之","author":"李献能","text":"突兀高台上古城，登临人境两峥嵘。\n关河落日岁云暮，草木临风气未平。\n虎掷龙拿王伯事，天荒地老古今情。\n一杯欲洗兴亡恨，为唤穷途阮步兵。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1960,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"从猎口号四首 其一","author":"李献能","text":"莲烛金纱簇簇齐，宫槐笼晓尚凄迷。\n景阳钟罢听残漏，万马衔霜不敢嘶。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1961,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"从猎口号四首 其二","author":"李献能","text":"阊阖传符?九关，一声清跸驻南山。\n虎贲先导三千士，天马初离十二闲。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1962,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"从猎口号四首 其三","author":"李献能","text":"烂烂龙旂捧日旂，从臣遥认赭红衣。\n天王清晓亲弧矢，初合今冬第一围。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1963,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"从猎口号四首 其四","author":"李献能","text":"的皪金鎞堕晓星，晴天霹雳应弦声。\n风毛雨血燕云在，未要草间狐兔惊。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1964,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"上清宫梅同座主閒閒公赋","author":"李献能","text":"厌住卢家白玉堂，琳宫潇洒占年芳。\n光生琪树风霜古，影占银潢月露凉。\n物外根株本仙种，世间红紫避严妆。\n遨头词伯今何逊，一笑诗成字字香。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1965,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"丹阳观竹宫中移赐","author":"李献能","text":"素士如林侍紫清，紫清新许住蓬瀛。\n娟娟粉节霜匀出，矗矗烟梢玉削成。\n福地根茎蒙化育，中天雨露借恩荣。\n绿章封事朝来奏，又听风前彩凤鸣。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1966,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"颍亭","author":"王渥","text":"三载西湖阻胜游，颍亭联喜散羁愁。\n九山西络烟霞去，一水南吞涧壑流。\n宾主唱酬空翠琰，干戈横绝自沧洲。\n匆匆匹马从军去，惭愧烟波万里鸥。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1967,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"有寄","author":"王渥","text":"十年铁马暗京华，客子飘零处处家。\n征雁久疏河朔信，小梅重见汝南花。\n栖栖活计依檐雀，冉冉年光赴壑蛇。\n旧雨故人应念我，不来联句夜煎茶。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1968,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"寄京父","author":"王渥","text":"忆昔相从在寝丘，城南城北纵欢游。\n杏花联句香随马，野水添杯浪拍舟。\n邂逅又成三月别，飘零合负一春愁。\n汝阳淮甸经行遍，应有新诗为我留。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1969,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"餐秀轩","author":"王渥","text":"秋风几日摇霜樾，秋色南山两奇绝。\n野人窗户终日开，要看千秋秦岭雪。\n层崖深谷相吐吞，落日白鹿东南奔。\n野花双塔古兰若，楼观缥缈烟霞昏。\n玉山生玉人不识，草木四时空好色。\n辋川旧与蓝桥通，细水至今流石室。\n一川黄叶长安秋，望望不见令人愁。\n书生不是济时具，收得閒身成此游。\n主人开筵留客醉，山雨多情湿征袂。\n明朝骑马上七盘，回首山家但空翠。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1970,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"游蓝田","author":"王渥","text":"甲申之秋月建戍，我行商岭正落木。\n山英似与行子期，拨雾披云到山腹。\n古潭千丈照锦峰，下有蛰龙上栖鹄。\n高风吹雪已多时，熊耳双尖寒欲缩。\n新乘一水出龙涡，惊见千峰遮木槲。\n南山秀拔北山雄，剑戟森然对群玉。\n崎岖直过蓝田西，始见商山真面目。\n悟真峡口忽中断，天末修眉画浓绿。\n此峡何年得此名，曾有金仙搆华屋。\n西岩石室悬细水，万斛琼珠输辋谷。\n行人尚说有七盘，瘦马已愁疲百曲。\n风门放眼望秦川，扰扰更嗟尘界局。\n去年游骑渡葭芦，万里横行如鬼速。\n灞陵原下马饮血，太华峰头虎择肉。\n今年九月未防秋，始见登场有新谷。\n一鞭莫指古招提，疏雨有情留客宿。\n主人闻客喜相接，尊酒笑谈如昔夙。\n蹇予懒散本真性，临水登山此生足。\n一行作吏志益违，十载从军双鬓秃。\n官家后日铸五兵，便拟买牛耕白鹿。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1971,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送裕之还嵩山","author":"王渥","text":"高怀不受簿书侵，清颍鸥盟欲重寻。\n老去宦情知我薄，閒来道念见君深。\n对床夜雨他年梦，满马西风此日心。\n嵩顶胜游谁得共，仙闻仙驭待知音。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1972,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"古仙人辞今附于此","author":"王渥","text":"梦入云山宫阙幽。\n鸑鷟同侣鸳凤流。\n桂月竟夜光不收。\n世俗扰扰成嚣湫。\n醉飞星驭鞭金虬。\n八仙浪迹追真游。\n龟玉筌蹄二十秋。\n摩霄注壑须人求。\n觅剑如或笑刻舟。\n阳燧非无角绮俦。\n元鼎以来虚昆丘。\n东井徒劳冠带修。\n松餐竹饮度蜃楼。\n崧顶坐啸垂直钩。\n秪应惭愧刘幽州。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1973,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"兴定庚辰夏六月望予与元好问赵郡李献能同游玉华谷又将历崧前诸刹因憩于少姨庙元周行廊庑得古仙人词于壁间然其首章直屋漏雨为所漫剥殆不可辨乃磴木石而上拂拭汛涤迫视者久之始可完读观其体则柏梁事则终始二汉字画在钟王之间东井又元鼎所都幽州必贤宗子虞也夫眷眷不忘幽州者非吾田畴尚谁欤田复所事之雠却曹瞒之赏衰俗波荡中挺挺有烈丈夫风气其死而不忘盖无疑其能道此语亦无疑观者不应以文体古今之变而疑仙语也噫仙山灵岳宜有闳衍博大","author":"王渥","text":"霜落丰山白水收，岁华全在竹园头。\n赋诗鞍马惭真赏，载酒林泉阻胜游。\n野色自随人意远，夕阳应为鸟声留。\n仙源回首旌旗隔，一笛西风唤客愁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1974,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"驿口桥看白莲","author":"王渥","text":"阴阴乔木障晴晖，的的冰蕖照碧漪。\n秋暑困人仍御扇，晚风生竹却添衣。\n百年蓬鬓关心切，千里莼羹与愿违。\n杖屦频来约他日，不妨先筑钓鱼矶。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1975,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"蒙城县斋","author":"王渥","text":"谷雨连朝没麦场，官粮未入长官忙。\n阶庭有雨青鞋闹，牢户无人白日长。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1976,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"三门津","author":"王渥","text":"层崖摩苍穹，四月号阴风。\n大河三门险，神禹万世功。\n他山亦崔嵬，砥柱独尊雄。\n雷霆日斗击，悍暴愁天公。\n刘侯智有馀，始令舟楫通。\n仍馀石上穴，飞栈曾连空。\n遥瞻白玉枝，挺植丹灶中。\n仙公去不返，此事真冥蒙。\n夫人与鼓崖，怪幻尤难穷。\n独喜兵火馀，岿然出新宫。\n当时疏凿意，四海要会同。\n谁知千岁后，筑垒防啸凶。\n诗成一大笑，浩浩洪波东。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1977,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"被檄再至扬州制司驿亭有题诗讥予和事不成者云来往二年无一事青山也解笑行人因为解嘲","author":"王渥","text":"二年奔走道途间，知被青山笑往还。\n只向江南南岸老，行人应更笑青山。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1978,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"僧房","author":"冀禹锡","text":"上方楼观裌衣寒，霜后川原眼界宽。\n我是禅房未归客，阿师休作长官看。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1979,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"赠雷御史兼及松庵冯丈","author":"冀禹锡","text":"平生疾恶如风手，力振台纲事所难。\n人道千钧羞射鼠，我怜众喣解漂山。\n明时士论知无负，晚岁交盟岂易寒。\n见说嵩前茹芝老，白云倚杖待君还。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1980,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其一","author":"张建","text":"飞云何冉冉，高与日月齐。\n中有两仙人，盛服持玉圭。\n我欲从之游，天险不可跻。\n邈焉望不及，短日西山西。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1981,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其二","author":"张建","text":"客从岳顶来，贻我松粉黄。\n为言服之久，身轻欲飞翔。\n我尝淡无味，我嗅寂无香。\n还君三太息，世好方膏粱。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1982,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其三","author":"张建","text":"枯桑依颓垣，摧折生理微。\n剥我枝间叶，备君身上衣。\n叶尽谁复顾，栖鸟来亦稀。\n君看牡丹丛，日日笙歌围。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1983,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其四","author":"张建","text":"青青河滨柳，柯叶柔且妍。\n一从智巧萌，戕贼为柸棬。\n器成岂不佳，天质失自然。\n争如河堤上，濯濯披春烟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1984,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其五","author":"张建","text":"石泉何清泠，中有九节蒲。\n蒲性本孤洁，不受滓秽污。\n一移入城市，生意寄泥淤。\n翠叶日焦卷，不霜而自枯。\n寄言守静者，勿涉奔竞途。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1985,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其六","author":"张建","text":"庭前兰蕙窠，三年种不成。\n门外旱蒺藜，一旦还自生。\n第恐伤我足，锄去根与萌。\n如何一雨后，走蔓复纵横。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1986,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其七","author":"张建","text":"有客曳长裾，袖刺谒高闳。\n低头拜阍者，始得通姓名。\n主人果厚眷，开宴海陆并。\n顾必承彼颜，语必顺彼情。\n不如茅檐下，饱我藜藿羹。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1987,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其八","author":"张建","text":"菶菶峄山桐，一树十二枝。\n枝分十二律，所指各不移。\n胡为师襄子，独谓东南奇。\n一律不可阙，一枝不可遗。\n谁能以此意，说似典乐夔。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1988,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其九","author":"张建","text":"美人何荧荧，颜若苕之英。\n绝世而独立，一顾倾人城。\n三星正当户，俟我亦在庭。\n之子无良媒，不敢犯露行。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1989,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟古十首 其十","author":"张建","text":"丘中有一士，颜貌清且癯。\n缊袍仅蔽体，蔬饭不满盂。\n时出蓬荜门，鼓腹歌黄虞。\n不知何所得，矫首望八区。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1990,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"山中","author":"张建","text":"林樱堕红珠，打着琴上弦。\n山人时一笑，爱此声琅然。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1991,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"韩信庙","author":"张建","text":"一檄风驰万垒降，当时意趣已难量。\n既能归汉识真主，何必下齐求假王。\n将幄深严岩树碧，门旌摇曳岭云黄。\n我诗责备春秋法，胜把君侯美处扬。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1992,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送张子玉","author":"张建","text":"渭水玻璃碧，秦山剑戟明。\n秋光如我瘦，行色与君清。\n蝉嘒西风柳，鸦翻落日城。\n归舟幸无物，且莫苦贪程。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1993,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"张建","text":"蠹树枝高茁朵稠，嫩苞开破雪搓毬。\n碎粘粉紫须齐吐，润卷丹黄叶半抽。\n月影晓窗留好梦，雨声深院锁清愁。\n琼胞已实香犹在，散入长安卖酒楼。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1994,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"答华阴宋先觉","author":"张建","text":"云台清集忆当年，诗笔逢君厌老拳。\n后会邈如千里远，壮怀不似十年前。\n风帘摇曳桥南酒，烟树溟濛渭北天。\n咫尺灵山飞不到，梦魂长绕玉?莲。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1995,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送贺彦淳还南邠","author":"张建","text":"玉峰明灭暮云边，默计归程约半千。\n襁负尚怜灵照幼，家贫赖有孟光贤。\n临岐泪眼三年别，夹路风槐六月天。\n伫立望君西去远，夕阳村落起孤烟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1996,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"山村风雨图","author":"张建","text":"雨昏山店望未见，风紧伞檐张不开。\n莫讶披图便成句，为曾行到此中来。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1997,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"渔父词 赋胡直之溪桥莲塘二首 其一","author":"张建","text":"溪桥脚下水平分，桥柱萍粘浪打痕。\n天向晚，日搀昏，两簇青烟断岸村。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1998,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"渔父词 赋胡直之溪桥莲塘二首 其二","author":"张建","text":"拂拂轻风漾翠澜，粉媒新扑小荷盘。\n塘水涨，岸痕漫，草阁临流五月寒。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1999,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杂诗二首 其一","author":"张建","text":"瓦瓶担山泉，石鼎煮岩菊。\n燎以松桂枝，清芬满茅屋。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2000,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杂诗二首 其二","author":"张建","text":"踏雪寻梅花，雪梅同一色。\n不是暗香来，梅花寻不得。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2001,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"俊师定庵","author":"张建","text":"渟泓石上泉，照我良是我。\n轻风一荡激，真态互掀簸。\n乃知求慧性，非戒定未可。\n道人此名庵，千劫付一坐。\n海月自澄明，天花任飞妥。\n吾生剧萍梗，万里信漂堕。\n湛然摩尼珠，坐受昏尘裹。\n何时陪远公，同社事香火。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2002,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送王主簿还乡","author":"张建","text":"笑君习气只书生，薄有归装亦自清。\n瘦仆担诗双笼重，羸牛引轭一车轻。\n长亭已过那知远，别酒犹多未忍倾。\n记取明年断肠处，玉梨花底月三更。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2003,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"游栖岩寺","author":"张瓒","text":"林表招人白塔明，竹间兰芷石泉清。\n惠崇水墨西轩景，烟带平芜水带城。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2004,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"无题","author":"毛麾","text":"小颦对起石州山，杨柳分青入髻鬟。\n乍识春风眼如鹘，为谁无语独凭阑。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2005,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"游河西孙氏园","author":"毛麾","text":"亭榭依山水乱鸣，已如罨画障中行。\n照溪芳树红云合，迎客幽禽翠羽轻。\n豪气未饶金谷友，醉魂如到锦官城。\n犹惭归骑匆匆去，不得持杯待月明。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2006,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"魏城马南瑞以异香见贻且索诗为赋二首 其一","author":"毛麾","text":"梅心兰甲类元同，气压荀家百和功。\n借润更烦纤手玉，出云初试博山铜。\n崇朝日下亭亭盖，三月花间细细风。\n我有因缘在香火，鼻端消息为君通。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2007,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"魏城马南瑞以异香见贻且索诗为赋二首 其二","author":"毛麾","text":"二卉真香岂复加，便宜编谱入䧺誇。\n留残一点蔷薇水，幻出诸天薝卜花。\n佩带正垂金钿小，薰炉孤起翠云斜。\n金笼甲帐豪华事，惭愧桑枢瓮牖家。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2008,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"新春雪与韩府推","author":"毛麾","text":"春到千门气自嘉，更教飞雪助年华。\n六街官柳枝枝絮，一夜江梅树树花。\n况是纵吟多伴侣，直须烂醉作生涯。\n埽庭迎客东风里，幕府风流有故家。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2009,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"和思达兄杏花","author":"毛麾","text":"碎剪明霞役化工，晓园香散暖烟中。\n羞逢柳眼三眠白，分得桃腮一笑红。\n上苑繁华迷故国，曲江憔悴老春风。\n欲传此恨花无语，强对芳时作醉翁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":2010,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}}]